WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.691 --> 00:00:07.559
&gt;&gt;&gt; It's been nearly a week

00:00:07.692 --> 00:00:10.228
since the evacuation order was

00:00:10.662 --> 00:00:11.663
lifted in east palestine, Ohio

00:00:11.797 --> 00:00:15.033
where a train carrying hazardous

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:17.169
chemicals derailed on February

00:00:17.302 --> 00:00:17.802
3rd.

00:00:17.803 --> 00:00:19.204
Three days later fearing an

00:00:19.337 --> 00:00:20.672
explosion, authorities

00:00:20.672 --> 00:00:22.674
controlled what they call the

00:00:22.674 --> 00:00:23.942
controlled release of the toxic

00:00:24.075 --> 00:00:25.177
chemicals and burned off which

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:26.678
created a massive black cloud

00:00:26.678 --> 00:00:28.246
over the town and while the EPA

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.215
has tried to reassure the public

00:00:30.348 --> 00:00:31.783
that the air and water in the

00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:34.352
area are safe, not all residents

00:00:34.686 --> 00:00:35.854
are convinced and they are

00:00:35.987 --> 00:00:37.556
incredibly concerned about the

00:00:37.689 --> 00:00:39.758
long-term potential impacts both

00:00:39.891 --> 00:00:42.861
on the environment and economy.

00:00:42.994 --> 00:00:44.029
Jason Carroll is in east

00:00:44.162 --> 00:00:46.064
palestine, Ohio.

00:00:46.198 --> 00:00:48.800
Ohio governor dewine gave an

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:49.901
update a short while ago.

00:00:50.035 --> 00:00:51.203
What did he have to say?

00:00:51.336 --> 00:00:51.836
&gt;&gt; Reporter: He did.

00:00:51.903 --> 00:00:52.704
He did.

00:00:52.704 --> 00:00:55.006
One of the headlines out of the

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:55.740
update from the glove New York

00:00:55.874 --> 00:00:58.109
City -- governor, as well as

00:00:58.243 --> 00:00:59.845
well as state health officials,

00:00:59.978 --> 00:01:02.714
they are strongly recommending

00:01:02.747 --> 00:01:03.415
those who evacuated and returned

00:01:03.548 --> 00:01:05.617
home, some of those folks say

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.919
you should drink bottled water

00:01:08.053 --> 00:01:09.120
unless further notice.

00:01:09.254 --> 00:01:11.122
This is especially true they say

00:01:11.256 --> 00:01:13.024
of pregnant women and women who

00:01:13.158 --> 00:01:13.959
are breast feeding.

00:01:14.092 --> 00:01:16.194
Also included in that are folks

00:01:16.328 --> 00:01:17.662
who have private wells.

00:01:17.796 --> 00:01:19.197
So this announcement just coming

00:01:19.331 --> 00:01:20.966
out just a short while ago.

00:01:21.099 --> 00:01:23.268
They're saying that again, most

00:01:23.401 --> 00:01:25.537
of the contaminants have been

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:26.738
contained but they want to wait

00:01:26.738 --> 00:01:29.074
for more testing to come back

00:01:29.207 --> 00:01:31.276
from the municipal testing that

00:01:31.409 --> 00:01:32.744
is still outstanding.

00:01:32.777 --> 00:01:34.012
So right now in terms of the

00:01:34.145 --> 00:01:36.114
cleanup effort, they're focused

00:01:36.248 --> 00:01:38.116
on four waterways.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.785
They do say that since the train

00:01:40.919 --> 00:01:41.786
derailment and since the

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.121
controlled release, they said

00:01:43.255 --> 00:01:47.759
now an estimated 3,500 fish have

00:01:47.893 --> 00:01:50.061
died from 12 different species.

00:01:50.195 --> 00:01:51.696
We spoke to a number of people

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.031
here on the ground who are

00:01:53.164 --> 00:01:54.232
hearing about this information.

00:01:54.366 --> 00:01:56.234
They are extremely frustrated

00:01:56.368 --> 00:01:58.003
and quite frankly, really

00:01:58.136 --> 00:01:59.170
worried about their safety.

00:01:59.304 --> 00:02:00.772
The governor was asking about

00:02:00.772 --> 00:02:02.841
that.
He said if he lived in the area,

00:02:02.974 --> 00:02:06.378
would he feel safe being at

00:02:06.778 --> 00:02:07.612
home?
&gt;&gt; I think that I would be

00:02:07.746 --> 00:02:11.716
drinking the bottled water and I

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:16.087
would be continuing to find out

00:02:16.221 --> 00:02:17.789
what the tests were showing as

00:02:17.923 --> 00:02:19.891
far as the air.

00:02:20.091 --> 00:02:23.395
I would be alert and concerned

00:02:23.528 --> 00:02:24.796
but I think I would probably be

00:02:24.863 --> 00:02:29.000
back in my house.

00:02:29.134 --> 00:02:30.035
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Again, state

00:02:30.168 --> 00:02:31.970
officials say the air quality is

00:02:32.103 --> 00:02:32.404
safe.

00:02:32.404 --> 00:02:33.538
They are still waiting for more

00:02:33.672 --> 00:02:34.973
test results on the water

00:02:35.106 --> 00:02:36.808
quality but a lot of people here

00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:38.810
feeling very unsafe at the

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:39.978
moment.
&gt;&gt; Yeah, understandably so.

00:02:40.111 --> 00:02:41.446
The town is inviting members of

00:02:41.579 --> 00:02:43.548
the community to get-togethers

00:02:43.682 --> 00:02:44.049
tomorrow.

00:02:44.049 --> 00:02:51.523
What do we

00:02:51.656 --> 00:02:52.257
&gt;&gt; From everything we've heard

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:52.991
here on the ground expect a lot

00:02:53.124 --> 00:02:54.192
of fireworks.

00:02:54.326 --> 00:02:56.194
&gt;&gt; Thanks so much.

00:02:56.328 --> 00:02:57.062
Another person who's been

00:02:57.195 --> 00:02:58.897
following this disaster closely

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:04.235
is consumer advocate and

00:03:04.369 --> 00:03:04.903
environmental disaster.

00:03:05.036 --> 00:03:07.906
The EPA has tried to assure

00:03:08.039 --> 00:03:10.842
residents any immediate danger

00:03:10.842 --> 00:03:13.345
has passed but about 3,500 fish

00:03:13.478 --> 00:03:14.879
have died in Ohio's waterways

00:03:15.013 --> 00:03:17.349
after the derailment when asked

00:03:17.482 --> 00:03:18.383
about those deaths and reports

00:03:18.516 --> 00:03:20.318
of people getting headaches and

00:03:20.452 --> 00:03:21.419
sore throats.

00:03:21.553 --> 00:03:23.221
The health director the state of

00:03:23.355 --> 00:03:24.923
Ohio says it doesn't look like

00:03:25.056 --> 00:03:27.592
air quality is to blame.

00:03:27.726 --> 00:03:29.461
What do you make of all this?

00:03:29.594 --> 00:03:33.565
&gt;&gt; Well, oh, my gosh.

00:03:33.698 --> 00:03:35.567
This kind of goes to show the

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:36.868
delay of information that's

00:03:36.868 --> 00:03:41.439
getting out to the people and

00:03:41.573 --> 00:03:42.440
addressing their concerns.

00:03:42.874 --> 00:03:43.908
Since this happened on February

00:03:44.075 --> 00:03:45.577
3rd I've been hearing from the

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.278
communities as early as February

00:03:47.412 --> 00:03:48.913
4th about children having

00:03:49.047 --> 00:03:51.850
breathing issues, onset of as

00:03:51.983 --> 00:03:54.252
muattacks, rashes, projectile

00:03:54.386 --> 00:03:55.720
vomiting, getting evacuation

00:03:55.854 --> 00:03:57.622
orders, not wearing where to go,

00:03:57.756 --> 00:03:58.890
to shelter in lace.

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:02.093
A lot of confusion, a lot of

00:04:02.227 --> 00:04:03.294
miscommunication if no

00:04:03.428 --> 00:04:03.862
communication.

00:04:03.862 --> 00:04:05.263
Here we are ten days out, and

00:04:05.397 --> 00:04:07.832
now you're just hearing the

00:04:07.966 --> 00:04:10.468
governor as your reporter just

00:04:10.902 --> 00:04:12.170
stated, now there's an issue

00:04:12.303 --> 00:04:14.105
with don't drink the water.

00:04:14.239 --> 00:04:16.508
This is precisely what's

00:04:16.908 --> 00:04:17.542
concerning this community

00:04:17.675 --> 00:04:18.910
because all the information

00:04:18.977 --> 00:04:20.111
isn't in yet.

00:04:20.245 --> 00:04:24.249
Look, it was a train derailment.

00:04:24.382 --> 00:04:29.654
Ten cars with a hazardous

00:04:29.788 --> 00:04:30.922
chemical, vinyl chloride, that

00:04:30.955 --> 00:04:32.924
was set to explode that they put

00:04:32.924 --> 00:04:35.126
into a controlled burn, and the

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:38.930
information isn't all in.

00:04:38.997 --> 00:04:41.032
So what assurance are you going

00:04:41.166 --> 00:04:43.234
to give this community that it

00:04:43.368 --> 00:04:45.236
is in fact safe, which has been

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:46.938
their concern all along.

00:04:46.971 --> 00:04:50.041
And now we're hearing drink

00:04:50.175 --> 00:04:50.608
bottled water.

00:04:50.608 --> 00:04:53.445
So this is a bad situation for

00:04:53.578 --> 00:04:54.946
this community, and they have

00:04:55.013 --> 00:04:56.948
every right to be concerned.

00:04:56.948 --> 00:04:59.184
And the reports go onto animals

00:04:59.317 --> 00:05:05.056
that have died, chickens, beyond

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:05.557
the fish.

00:05:05.557 --> 00:05:11.329
So this is so mismanaged.

00:05:11.463 --> 00:05:13.498
And there's a systemic issue

00:05:13.631 --> 00:05:14.966
going on in all these

00:05:15.066 --> 00:05:16.434
environmental issues that aren't

00:05:16.568 --> 00:05:17.802
being addressed, and leaders

00:05:17.936 --> 00:05:19.604
need to show up at that town

00:05:19.737 --> 00:05:21.406
hall and be present and hear

00:05:21.539 --> 00:05:22.640
what's happening to that

00:05:22.974 --> 00:05:25.610
community.
So it's very frustrating and

00:05:25.743 --> 00:05:26.144
concerning.

00:05:26.144 --> 00:05:28.146
&gt;&gt; The Ohio EPA says it's not

00:05:28.279 --> 00:05:30.014
sure how much of these chemicals

00:05:30.148 --> 00:05:31.950
spilled into the soil or the

00:05:32.083 --> 00:05:34.986
water.
They also acinformationed the

00:05:34.986 --> 00:05:36.554
cleanup of the derailment site

00:05:36.988 --> 00:05:37.989
could literally take years.

00:05:38.123 --> 00:05:40.525
Is this an indication that

00:05:40.658 --> 00:05:43.061
people should not live in east

00:05:43.194 --> 00:05:45.730
palestine, Ohio, or the

00:05:45.864 --> 00:05:46.364
surrounding area?

00:05:46.364 --> 00:05:46.998
&gt;&gt; That's exactly what the

00:05:47.098 --> 00:05:48.500
community wants to know.

00:05:48.633 --> 00:05:49.801
And as long as this information

00:05:49.934 --> 00:05:51.836
isn't given to them, full

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:53.771
transparency whether you do or

00:05:53.905 --> 00:05:55.340
don't know something, you leave

00:05:55.473 --> 00:05:57.909
them in a horrible, vulnerable

00:05:58.042 --> 00:06:01.412
position to return to an

00:06:01.546 --> 00:06:03.014
environment that is unsafe.

00:06:03.081 --> 00:06:05.016
And that is absolutely

00:06:05.083 --> 00:06:07.952
unacceptable from local, state,

00:06:08.086 --> 00:06:09.587
and any federal authorities.

00:06:09.721 --> 00:06:11.589
Look, this community wants to

00:06:11.723 --> 00:06:13.391
believe that the oversight is

00:06:13.525 --> 00:06:15.026
protecting them, but we're

00:06:15.026 --> 00:06:17.762
hearing way too many stories how

00:06:17.896 --> 00:06:19.297
long it could be for cleanup.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.167
We don't have all the data yet.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:23.368
Don't drink the water.

00:06:23.501 --> 00:06:27.038
Why would they want to live

00:06:27.038 --> 00:06:27.739
there?
At this point I don't think

00:06:27.872 --> 00:06:32.577
there's faith or trust, Jake, in

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:34.379
what the government agencies are

00:06:34.512 --> 00:06:35.246
telling them.

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.315
&gt;&gt; You've been call on the Biden

00:06:37.448 --> 00:06:38.449
administration to be better

00:06:38.583 --> 00:06:41.386
about communicating with the

00:06:41.519 --> 00:06:42.420
residents of east palestine,

00:06:42.554 --> 00:06:45.957
Ohio, who as you know feel as

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.525
they've been left in the dark.

00:06:47.659 --> 00:06:49.594
What should the Biden

00:06:49.727 --> 00:06:51.062
administration, what should the

00:06:51.129 --> 00:06:52.263
EPA do differently?

00:06:52.397 --> 00:06:55.066
&gt;&gt; Show up and hear that

00:06:55.066 --> 00:06:58.069
community, see that community,

00:06:58.203 --> 00:06:59.571
listen to that community.

00:06:59.704 --> 00:07:01.906
Go out there, find the dead

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.641
animals, do the testing, start

00:07:03.775 --> 00:07:06.077
doing water testing, and being

00:07:06.211 --> 00:07:08.580
trance parent with them.

00:07:08.713 --> 00:07:11.616
Look, by not showing up, by not

00:07:11.749 --> 00:07:16.754
addressing this, it's a national

00:07:17.088 --> 00:07:19.090
train derailment with very

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:21.659
hazardous information, you do

00:07:21.793 --> 00:07:23.094
nothing but create a vacuum of

00:07:23.161 --> 00:07:24.596
an upset community, a

00:07:24.729 --> 00:07:27.765
misinformed community, a

00:07:27.899 --> 00:07:28.633
distrusting community, and it

00:07:28.766 --> 00:07:30.168
adds to rumors, speculation,

00:07:30.301 --> 00:07:33.104
losing trust and a lot of

00:07:33.104 --> 00:07:35.106
theories.
Show up and answer their

00:07:35.173 --> 00:07:37.108
questions, be present, act like

00:07:37.108 --> 00:07:39.177
you care about what's going on

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:40.311
in your backyard in this country

00:07:40.445 --> 00:07:43.414
and be involved and not just sit

00:07:43.548 --> 00:07:45.450
there and give them a bunch of

00:07:45.583 --> 00:07:46.050
misinformation.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:47.719
And then you wonder why they're

00:07:47.852 --> 00:07:48.419
frustrated.

00:07:48.553 --> 00:07:49.053
Show up.

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:53.558
&gt;&gt; What are you expecting at the

00:07:53.691 --> 00:07:56.227
open house, the town hall

00:07:56.361 --> 00:07:56.728
tomorrow?

00:07:56.728 --> 00:07:58.463
&gt;&gt; So right before we came on I

00:07:58.596 --> 00:08:03.134
heard they've changed that town

00:08:03.134 --> 00:08:03.801
hall which would be a format for

00:08:03.935 --> 00:08:05.470
the community to ask and get

00:08:05.603 --> 00:08:07.772
questions answered, it's been

00:08:07.905 --> 00:08:09.140
turned into an informational

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:11.542
desk where you can go and get

00:08:11.676 --> 00:08:15.146
information, of which I

00:08:15.146 --> 00:08:19.884
understand Norfolk railroad will

00:08:20.018 --> 00:08:22.654
be there.

00:08:22.787 --> 00:08:25.156
So the town hall isn't going to

00:08:25.256 --> 00:08:27.158
be as expected so I expect

00:08:27.158 --> 00:08:29.160
there'll be even more outraged

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:30.662
and upset citizens who now

